msgid "Your parent or guardian has turned this off for your account."
msgstr "Prindi ose kujdestari yt e ka fikur këtë për llogarinë tënde."

msgid "Your parent or guardian made this account for you. They can see what you do on the site (your posts, comments, votes, bookmarks, follows, guilds, who you chat with, that your account was reported and your recent sign-ins; the site never shows them what your chats say) and they choose which features are on. You can see which in [Settings > Content](/settings/content). They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it, because anyone who knows it can sign in as you and read your chats."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your parent or guardian set a new password for your account and you were signed out. Sign in with the new password, then change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security) so that only you know it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your parent or guardian stopped managing your account. It keeps the child lock until you confirm your age in Settings > Content. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your parent or guardian's account was suspended, so yours is suspended until theirs is back."
